OL,3,GNEWSAMajor travel disruption and
OL,4,Athousands without power as Storm Austen
OL,5,Ahits UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Austen is causing widespread
OL,8,Fpower cuts and travel disruption ` with
OL,9,Fwind gusts of 84mph (135km/h) recorded
OL,10,Fat Jersey Airport
OL,12,FMore than 18,000 homes in parts of
OL,13,FEngland and Wales are without power, as
OL,14,Fmillions remain under a yellow weather
OL,15,Fwarning for wind
OL,17,FIn Brighton, a section of the iconic
OL,18,FWest Pier has collapsed. One local says
OL,19,Fhe is "shocked by the amount of pier
OL,20,Fthat's ended up in the sea"
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
