OL,3,GNEWSAMajor travel disruption and
OL,4,Athousands without power as Storm Austen
OL,5,Ahits UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrains are being hit by cancellations
OL,8,Fand delays in parts of the UK due to
OL,9,Fstrong winds and fallen trees - here's
OL,10,Fa rundown of the disruption
OL,12,FOne man tells us he was evacuated from
OL,13,Fa motorway service station near
OL,14,FBicester after it was hit by a power
OL,15,Fcut, while Sara Gatland in Guernsey
OL,16,Fsays her flight home to Edinburgh was
OL,17,Fcancelled due to the stormy weather
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
