OL,3,GNEWSAMajor travel disruption and
OL,4,Athousands without power as Storm Austen
OL,5,Ahits UK
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,8,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,9,Fwinds to Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,10,Fnorthern England, with yellow and amber
OL,11,Fwarnings in place
OL,13,FIn parts of Scotland, rail lines will
OL,14,Fclose from 21:00 on Saturday, according
OL,15,Fto Network Rail, while people are being
OL,16,Fadvised to avoid all travel unless
OL,17,Fnecessary
